ROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987

MOTOR VEHICLE (CONSTRUCTION AND USE) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2016

IN exercise of the powers conferred by section 66 of

the Road Transport Act 1987 [Act 333], the Minister makes the following rules:

Citation and commencement

1. (1) These rules may be cited as the Motor Vehicles (Construction and Use)

(Amendment) Rules 2016.

(2) These Rules come into operation on 1 July 2017.

Substitution of Third Schedule

2. The Motor Vehicles (Construction and Use) Rules 1959 [L.N. 170/1959] are

amended by substituting for the Third Schedule the following Schedule:

